-> walk_intro

=== walk_intro ===
Today's faces have gathered in the plaza.
The dog watches quietly beside you.
You: Let's say hello for a moment.
-> END

=== walk_lumi_A_deepened ===
Lumi: Everything's best when we're all together!
Lumi: Let's invite even more people tomorrow!
-> END

=== walk_lumi_A_steady ===
Lumi: I loved being together again today!
Lumi: I can still hear everyone laughing!
-> END

=== walk_lumi_A_wavering ===
Lumi: Wow, a quiet moment can be nice sometimes!
Lumi: Walking with you taught me that!
-> END

=== walk_lumi_A_turned ===
Lumi: Today I feel like walking alone for a while!
Lumi: Funny, isn't it?
-> END

=== walk_lumi_C_deepened ===
Lumi: Next time, let's try what nobody has tried!
Lumi: My heart's racing already!
-> END

=== walk_lumi_C_steady ===
Lumi: What new thing will tomorrow bring?
Lumi: Let's go find it together!
-> END

=== walk_lumi_C_wavering ===
Lumi: Wow, the old songs are pretty good too!
Lumi: Even I stopped to listen!
-> END

=== walk_lumi_C_turned ===
Lumi: I want this year's festival to stay just as it is!
Lumi: Familiar things are lovely too!
-> END

=== walk_moka_B_deepened ===
Moka: People's hearts come first. I'm sure of it now.
Moka: Bread and kindness should both be shared warm.
-> END

=== walk_moka_B_steady ===
Moka: I looked at my customers' faces first again today.
Moka: It's okay. That's still me.
-> END

=== walk_moka_B_wavering ===
Moka: Some days, a kind heart isn't quite enough.
Moka: Even dough needs measuring, you know.
-> END

=== walk_moka_B_turned ===
Moka: These days I open the ledger first.
Moka: It's okay. This me feels familiar too.
-> END

=== walk_moka_D_deepened ===
Moka: An oven should warm up slowly, after all.
Moka: I'm glad nothing was rushed.
-> END

=== walk_moka_D_steady ===
Moka: I baked slowly again today.
Moka: Take your time.
-> END

=== walk_moka_D_wavering ===
Moka: Maybe I can turn the heat up now and then.
Moka: It's okay. If it burns, I'll bake again.
-> END

=== walk_moka_D_turned ===
Moka: I might bake a new bread first thing tomorrow.
Moka: I just want to give it a try.
-> END

=== walk_echo_B_deepened ===
Echo: Records should start with the facts.
Echo: I confirmed that again today.
-> END

=== walk_echo_B_steady ===
Echo: I went through the records again today.
Echo: One more look, then.
-> END

=== walk_echo_B_wavering ===
Echo: I've started reading the feelings outside the records.
Echo: The margins hold stories too.
-> END

=== walk_echo_B_turned ===
Echo: Today I looked at the person before the rule.
Echo: My records have nothing like that.
-> END

=== walk_echo_C_deepened ===
Echo: The shelves I haven't read interest me even more.
Echo: I'm off to find a new story.
-> END

=== walk_echo_C_steady ===
Echo: I found another new story today.
Echo: I wonder what the next chapter holds.
-> END

=== walk_echo_C_wavering ===
Echo: I reopened a book I've read for years.
Echo: The same line read differently.
-> END

=== walk_echo_C_turned ===
Echo: I want to go back to my usual shelf.
Echo: I checked. That's where I feel at ease.
-> END

